Z||000002||Dave Gunsul||12-30-2001||03:58 AM||||I have the bored out t-body and upper intake from Darrell Morse. It works great!<BR>The car is notably faster but I don't have any dyno runs to back that up. I have heard that the t-body produce only 3 HP and 3 LB Ft torque to the rear wheels but this is what I heard and is not supported by any facts that i've ever seen. The upper intake should add 1 or 2 more horses to that.<BR> I will say that it sure feels stronger and I would recomend it to anyone. Darrells machine work is top notch too and you won't be disappointed by his work or price.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>Activities Director<BR>Northern IL. Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
